      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبْتِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>One who fasts alone on the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبْت</span> [i. e.
<i>sabbath,</i> or <i>Saturday</i>]: thus in the saying mentioned by Th, on the authority of IAar, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا تَكُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبْتِيًّا</span> [<i>Be not thou one who fasts</i> &amp;c.]. (M.)

